OL,3,GNEWSAHeart attack inspires man to run
OL,4,Ahalf marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had a heart attack on his
OL,7,Fhoneymoon said it felt like he "had
OL,8,Fdeath hanging over my shoulder".
OL,10,FPeter Franklin, from Fleetwood in
OL,11,FLancashire, said he was fighting for
OL,12,Fhis life in hospital 24 hours after
OL,13,Farriving in the Caribbean with his new
OL,14,Fwife Kim.
OL,16,FThe 53-year-old said: "Due to the
OL,17,Flocation we were in, I was having the
OL,18,Fheart attack for four hours before I
OL,19,Fgot to a hospital - I honestly don't
OL,20,Fknow how I survived."
